# ── Database dumps ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are recorded getAll/getUsers responses. They hold every student
# record (names, parent emails, mobile numbers) and every staff account
# with its password. They were being served publicly at /response.json.
# They must never reach a deployment.
response.json
response_new.json
response*.json

